Z||000000||DISenchanted||09-14-1999||01:18 PM||||My car makes some really odd noises.  The first one almost sounds like and exhaust leak, except it only makes the noise while accelerating.  The second noise is a vibrating hum that seems to come from the front of the car, it increases with speed.  there is also a weird tapping noise in the engine, it sounds more like a very small typewriter.  The last noise is a rattling noise from the drivers door.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Dale||09-14-1999||01:41 PM||||Exhaust leak, wheel bearing, valvetrain,door latch or window.<BR>hows that for summing it up?<BR>for engine noises take a piece of hose about 3' long (I use 3/4 ID clear stuff)and use it like a stethascope to pinpoint noises.  The door you might have to bump it around a little bit to find that one.||||reg||1
Z||000002||batboy||09-15-1999||02:15 PM||||It's hard to figure out noises without actually hearing them, but I think Dale is probably right on most of his "guesses". Fiero doors are kind of bad about rattling, especially when the hinges (pins) and door latches/striker plates get some wear on them. Look into that front end noise first, that could be potentially dangerous.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Dale||09-15-1999||08:49 PM||||Ditto on the front end and yes those are purely educated guesses.<BR>Have fun!||||reg||1
